#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:62
#: 691f47d8887641b09ebb922c022563fb
msgid "Position Targets"
msgstr "位置目标"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:64
#: de781a3063004a7ab4d92ac0345d7a1e
msgid ""
"To command the altitude in any supported frame, use "
"`SET_POSITION_TARGET_GLOBAL_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_GLOBAL_INT>`__."
" Ensure to set the `POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK>`__ bit"
" 3."
msgstr ""
"要在任何支持的坐标系中指令高度，请使用 `SET_POSITION_TARGET_GLOBAL_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_GLOBAL_INT>`__。确保设置"
" `POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK>`__ 的第 "
"3 位。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:67
#: a90a66a92e854aaebe9029570cc524ef
msgid ""
"To command the altitude in LOCAL frame, use `SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__."
" It is currently not necessary to bother with `POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK>`__. "
"The `MAV_FRAME <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_FRAME>`__ "
"must be ``MAV_FRAME_LOCAL_OFFSET_NED``."
msgstr ""
"要在 LOCAL 坐标系中指令高度，请使用 `SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__。目前无需处理"
" `POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK>`__。`MAV_FRAME"
" <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_FRAME>`__ 必须为 "
"``MAV_FRAME_LOCAL_OFFSET_NED``。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:71
#: 0052c17852b14809a5e891ea5e45186c
msgid ""
"No other fields in position target messages are currently supported. Use "
":ref:`movement_commands` to send a lat lon alt target."
msgstr "目前不支持位置目标消息中的其他字段。使用 :ref:`movement_commands` 发送纬度、经度、高度目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:74
#: dc0e235965a843198490f47694115ff5
msgid "Attitude Targets"
msgstr "姿态目标"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:76
#: 1ff770c953044921a6c0c1485144a9fb
msgid ""
"The low level attitude of the vehicle can be controlled with "
"`SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET>`__. "
"Attitude command must be sent to the autopilot continuously. If attitude "
"command is missing for more than :ref:`GUIDED_TIMEOUT<GUIDED_TIMEOUT>` "
"seconds, then the autopilot will revert back to the “fly to” command using "
"the previous commanded position."
msgstr ""
"载具的底层姿态可通过 `SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET>`__ "
"控制。姿态命令必须持续发送给飞控。如果姿态命令缺失超过 :ref:`GUIDED_TIMEOUT<GUIDED_TIMEOUT>` "
"秒，飞控将恢复为使用先前指令位置的“飞往”命令。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The low level attitude of the vehicle can be controlled with "
#~ "`SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET "
#~ "<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET>`__."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "飞行器的底层姿态可通过 `SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET "
#~ "<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_ATTITUDE_TARGET>`__ 进行控制。"
